Third-Party Components

NAS4USB bundles or integrates separate open-source software. Their licenses apply
independently of this program's MIT terms. A curated list of major components
is below; the full inventory of direct npm dependencies is in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

| Component | License | Source |
|-----------|---------|--------|
| Electron (+ Chromium) | MIT (+ Chromium licenses) | https://github.com/electron/electron |
| React / React DOM | MIT | https://github.com/facebook/react |
| Vite | MIT | https://github.com/vitejs/vite |
| Yjs / y-websocket / y-prosemirror | MIT | https://github.com/yjs |
| TipTap (+ ProseMirror) | MIT | https://github.com/ueberdosis/tiptap |
| CodeMirror 6 | MIT | https://github.com/codemirror/dev |
| FortuneSheet | MIT | https://github.com/ruilisi/fortune-sheet |
| rhwp (@rhwp/core, @rhwp/editor) | MIT | https://github.com/edwardkim/rhwp |
| WhiteBoard4Share (wb4s) | AGPL-3.0-only | https://github.com/soonpyopark/WhiteBoard4Share |
| PDF.js (pdfjs-dist) | Apache-2.0 | https://github.com/mozilla/pdf.js |
| Video.js | Apache-2.0 | https://github.com/videojs/video.js |
| hls.js | Apache-2.0 | https://github.com/video-dev/hls.js |
| FFmpeg (user-registered, not bundled) | LGPL / GPL | https://ffmpeg.org |
| epub.js (epubjs) | BSD-2-Clause | https://github.com/futurepress/epub.js |
| 7zip-min / 7zip-bin | MIT / LGPL | comic archive extract |
| Pandoc (bundled binary, HWPX export) | GPL-2.0-or-later | https://github.com/jgm/pandoc |
| pypandoc-hwpx (vendored) | MIT | https://github.com/msjang/pypandoc-hwpx |
| pypandoc | MIT | https://github.com/JessicaTegner/pypandoc |
| Pillow | MIT-CMU | https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow |
| SheetJS Community (xlsx) | Apache-2.0 | https://sheetjs.com/ |
| xlsx-js-style | Apache-2.0 | https://github.com/gitbrent/xlsx-js-style |
| JSZip | MIT OR GPL-3.0-or-later | https://github.com/Stuk/jszip |
| KaTeX | MIT | https://katex.org |
| lowlight | MIT | https://github.com/wooorm/lowlight |
| tippy.js | MIT | https://atomiks.github.io/tippyjs/ |
| ws | MIT | https://github.com/websockets/ws |
| Tailwind CSS | MIT | https://tailwindcss.com |
| Sharp | Apache-2.0 | https://sharp.pixelplumbing.com |
| Source Han Serif K (rhwp fonts) | SIL OFL 1.1 | bundled under public/rhwp-studio/fonts/ |

Editor core versions: lib/cores-manifest.json.
HWPX export toolchain: tools/hwpx-export/ (see tools/hwpx-export/README.md).
Offline USB update packages may be placed under lib/updates/ (see lib/updates/README.md).

Rhwp studio WASM bundles (public/rhwp-studio/, public/rhwp-core/) and wb4s editor
bundles (public/wb4s-editor/) are built from upstream sources during npm run build
and are not authored as first-party source of this repository.

The bundled Pandoc executable is distributed under GPL-2.0-or-later and remains a
separate program invoked for TipTap/Markdown → HWPX conversion; NAS4USB's MIT
license does not relicense Pandoc.

Portable/Electron distributions also include LICENSE.electron.txt and
LICENSES.chromium.html from the Electron runtime.
